┌───────────────────────────┐
│ Summary                   │
│                           │
│ Uniform acceleration      │
│ means constant            │
│ acceleration, leading to  │
│ predictable motion        │
│ described by kinematic    │
│ equations. It plays a     │
│ foundational role in      │
│ classical mechanics.      │
