### Suggested Questions

- How is uniform acceleration different from non-uniform acceleration?  
- Can an object have uniform acceleration but changing direction?  
- Why is the position-time graph parabolic under uniform acceleration?  
- How does air resistance affect uniform acceleration in real life?  

